        "created_at": "2016-02-17T02:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Then Resurrection Ritual came up, but I didn't have to make any choices there.&nbsp; But I could see a potential fuzziness there as well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm hoping Parse's Gauge Power allows the Shinobi to be moved to the bottom of the deck.&nbsp; It does not say \"Reveal\" or any of the words used on the card.&nbsp; It says \"look at\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the quick replies.</p>",
